{"product_id":"sylvester","title":"Sylvester","description":"\u003cp\u003eEndowed With Rank, Wealth And Elegance, Sylvester, Duke Of Salford, Posts Into Wiltshire To Discover If The Honorable Phoebe Marlow Will Meet His Exacting Requirements For A Bride. If He Does Not Expect To Meet A Tongue-Tied Stripling Wanting Both Manners And Conduct, Then He Is Intrigued Indeed When His Visit Causes Phoebe To Flee Her Home. They Meet Again On The Road To London, Where Her Carriage Has Come To Grief In The Snow. Yet Phoebe, Already Caught In One Imbroglio, Now Knows She Soon Could Be Well Deep In Another ...\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Georgette Heyer\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780099465775\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 352\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45834252615833,"sku":"17RD-29780099465775","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ff3d9c88b86_Sylvester_Georgette_Heyer.jpg?v=1761582653","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/sylvester","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}